WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.218
The inbox is where you will spend most of your time. It shows every conversation, what the AI suggests, and everything known about each lead.

00:00:09.368 --> 00:00:20.634
On the left are your conversations, newest first. A dot means unread. Use the filters at the top to see only unread, follow ups, or the ones that need a person.

00:00:20.784 --> 00:00:29.085
Click a conversation to open it in the middle. Messages the AI sent are marked AI, so you can always tell who wrote what.

00:00:29.235 --> 00:00:44.746
At the top, choose what the AI does for this lead. Off means you write every reply. Suggest means it drafts a reply for you to approve. Autopilot means it replies by itself, inside Instagram's twenty four hour window.

00:00:44.896 --> 00:00:55.138
In Suggest mode, the draft appears above the reply box, with the reason for it. Edit the words if you like, then press Send. Or press Rewrite for another version.

00:00:55.288 --> 00:01:03.695
You can always write the reply yourself. Type a forward slash to drop in one of your saved messages, with the lead's name filled in.

00:01:03.845 --> 00:01:15.325
On the right is everything known about the lead. A summary of the conversation so far, the stage, tags, and what they have told you. The AI keeps this filled in as it goes.

00:01:15.475 --> 00:01:22.367
Use Follow up to flag a conversation to come back to, and Done when it is finished. That keeps the list short.

00:01:22.517 --> 00:01:31.330
One more thing. Every panel can be moved, resized or hidden. Press Layout, at the bottom of the menu, to change it or put it back.
